misfits-event-ghoul-horde = A pack of feral ghouls has been stirred up nearby.

misfits-event-ghost-notice = {$event} has started nearby.

misfits-admin-menu-events-tab = Events

misfits-ghost-role-picker-title = Choose your character
misfits-ghost-role-picker-description = Take the role as one of your own characters that fits it, or as a randomly generated one.
misfits-ghost-role-picker-random = Randomly generated character
misfits-ghost-role-picker-take = Take role
misfits-ghost-role-picker-cancel = Cancel
misfits-ghost-role-picker-none = You have no characters that fit this role.

misfits-ghost-role-ghoul-name = Sentient Feral Ghoul
misfits-ghost-role-ghoul-description = A feral ghoul that kept enough of its mind to think for itself. It runs with the horde it spawned alongside, and can scream to send them at prey.
misfits-ghost-role-ghoul-rules = You are a sentient feral ghoul. Stay with your horde, do not attack other ghouls, and use your rally to lead them.
misfits-ghost-role-banned = You are banned from taking this ghost role.

misfits-event-dragon = Something large has nested in the wastes nearby.
misfits-event-slave = A runaway has bolted from Legion captivity, with hunters on their heels.
misfits-event-law = A wanted criminal has been seen nearby.
misfits-event-law-ranger = A Ranger has arrived, looking for the fugitive.
misfits-event-raiders = Raiders are moving in.
misfits-event-caravan = A travelling caravan has set up shop nearby.

misfits-ghost-role-raider-name = Sentient Raider
misfits-ghost-role-raider-description = One of the raiders riding in. You have a crew and a bad idea.
misfits-ghost-role-raider-rules = Cause trouble for the town with your crew and slip away afterwards. No spawn camping.
misfits-ghost-role-slave-name = Escaped Slave
misfits-ghost-role-slave-description = Legion property on the run, with two hunters coming after you.
misfits-ghost-role-slave-rules = Run and survive. Do not fight your hunters unless you are cornered.
misfits-ghost-role-hunter-name = Legion Bounty Hunter
misfits-ghost-role-hunter-description = A hired Legion hand sent to drag a runaway back.
misfits-ghost-role-hunter-rules = Bring the runaway back. Do not harm bystanders without cause.
misfits-ghost-role-criminal-name = Wanted Criminal
misfits-ghost-role-criminal-description = Someone the Rangers want badly enough to come looking.
misfits-ghost-role-criminal-rules = Stay free. A Ranger is on their way.
misfits-ghost-role-ranger-name = NCR Ranger
misfits-ghost-role-ranger-description = A Ranger sent to bring a fugitive to justice.
misfits-ghost-role-ranger-rules = Bring the criminal in alive if you can. Do not attack bystanders.
misfits-ghost-role-trader-name = Travelling Trader
misfits-ghost-role-trader-description = A caravan master with exotic stock and two guards.
misfits-ghost-role-trader-rules = Sell your stock and keep the caravan intact.
misfits-ghost-role-caravan-guard-name = Caravan Guard
misfits-ghost-role-caravan-guard-description = Hired gun for a travelling caravan.
misfits-ghost-role-caravan-guard-rules = Protect the trader and the wagon.
misfits-ghost-role-gecko-name = Alpha Fire Gecko
misfits-ghost-role-gecko-description = A big fire gecko that has claimed a nest.
misfits-ghost-role-gecko-rules = Guard your nest and your brood.
misfits-ghost-role-gecko-pack-name = Fire Gecko
misfits-ghost-role-gecko-pack-description = A fire gecko raised in the alpha's nest, quick to bite and quick to follow the pack.
misfits-ghost-role-gecko-pack-rules = Guard the nest and follow your alpha.

action-name-ghoul-rally = Rally the horde
action-desc-ghoul-rally = Scream for the feral ghouls around you. They will follow you into the fight.

misfits-ghoul-rally-cry = screeches a rallying cry for the horde!
misfits-ghoul-rally-none = Nothing out here answers your call.
misfits-ghoul-rally-answered =
    { $count ->
        [one] One ghoul answers your call.
       *[other] { $count } ghouls answer your call.
    }

misfits-gecko-nest-fed = The nest swallows the offering. { $fed }/{ $cost }
misfits-gecko-nest-grown = Something stirs in the nest.

action-name-gecko-make-nest = Make nest
action-desc-gecko-make-nest = Shape a nest of shells and bones for your brood. Feed it meat to raise more geckos.

misfits-name-prompt-title = Name yourself
misfits-name-prompt-description = You are this creature now. Give it the name the wastes will know it by.
misfits-name-prompt-take = Take the name
misfits-name-prompt-keep = Keep the default

misfits-objective-raider = Make the town's day worse
misfits-objective-raider-desc = Rob, brawl and wreck with your crew, then slip away.
misfits-objective-slave = Stay out of Legion hands
misfits-objective-slave-desc = Your hunters are coming. Run and survive.
misfits-objective-hunter = Bring the runaway back
misfits-objective-hunter-desc = Catch the escaped slave.
misfits-objective-criminal = Stay free
misfits-objective-criminal-desc = A Ranger is coming for you.
misfits-objective-ranger = Bring the criminal to justice
misfits-objective-ranger-desc = Find the wanted criminal and bring them in.

# What a raider crew is after; rolled once per raid and shared by every raider.
misfits-raider-motive-0 = Take what the town has and be gone before the dust settles.
misfits-raider-motive-1 = The boss wants this place emptied. Coin, chems, anything that is not nailed down.
misfits-raider-motive-2 = These settlers sold your crew out. Make them pay for it.
misfits-raider-motive-3 = Somebody in town is sitting on a stash that should have been yours.
misfits-raider-motive-4 = Prove you are worth your keep. Come back with loot.

# The ranger's warrant; $criminal is the name of the body that took the criminal role this run.
misfits-ncr-warrant-0 = A warrant is out on $criminal. Bring them in, alive if you can.
misfits-ncr-warrant-1 = The Republic wants $criminal standing trial. That is the job.
misfits-ncr-warrant-2 = $criminal was last seen in town. Do not let them slip away.
misfits-ncr-warrant-3 = Track $criminal down and bring them back, in chains if you have to.

# The charge rolled for the law event; the criminal and the ranger are both told this same line.
misfits-ncr-crime-0 = Wanted by the NCR for murder.
misfits-ncr-crime-1 = Wanted by the NCR for manslaughter.
misfits-ncr-crime-2 = Wanted by the NCR for assault.
misfits-ncr-crime-3 = Wanted by the NCR for armed robbery.
misfits-ncr-crime-4 = Wanted by the NCR for theft.
misfits-ncr-crime-5 = Wanted by the NCR for trafficking illegal chems.
misfits-ncr-crime-6 = Wanted by the NCR for sabotaging NCR equipment.
misfits-ncr-crime-7 = Wanted by the NCR for sedition.
misfits-ncr-crime-8 = Wanted by the NCR for treason.
misfits-ncr-crime-9 = Wanted by the NCR for cannibalism.
misfits-ncr-crime-10 = Wanted by the NCR for desertion from the NCRA.
misfits-ncr-crime-11 = Wanted by the NCR for hooliganism.
misfits-ncr-crime-12 = Wanted by the NCR for Arson.
misfits-objective-trader = Sell your stock
misfits-objective-trader-desc = Keep the caravan in business.
misfits-objective-caravan-guard = Protect the caravan
misfits-objective-caravan-guard-desc = Keep the trader and the wagon safe.

misfits-event-radio-note = Team radio frequency: { $frequency }.
    Set your handheld radio to it to reach the rest of your group.

GhostRoles = Ghost roles
department-GhostRoles-description = Per-player access to event ghost roles.
job-name-misfits-ghost-role-ghoul = Sentient ghoul (ghost role access)
